{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118453","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118453/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118453/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118453/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118453","id":4246514855,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HKyn","number":118453,"title":"Integer overflow in RenderingDevice::_texture_create_reinterpret_buffer() buffer size calculation","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:26:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:10Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn `servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:2567-2568`, the buffer size calculation for texture reinterpretation has two bugs:\n\n```cpp\nuint32_t pixel_bytes = get_image_format_pixel_size(p_texture->format);\nuint32_t row_pitch = STEPIFY(p_texture->width * pixel_bytes, row_pitch_step);\nuint64_t buffer_size = STEPIFY(pixel_bytes * row_pitch * p_texture->height * p_texture->depth, transfer_alignment);\n```\n\n**Bug 1: Integer overflow.** `pixel_bytes * row_pitch` is `uint32_t * uint32_t` arithmetic that overflows before being implicitly converted to `uint64_t`. For a 16384x16384 RGBA8 texture: `pixel_bytes=4`, `row_pitch=65536`, `pixel_bytes * row_pitch = 262144`, `262144 * 16384 = 4,294,967,296` — overflows `uint32_t`, wraps to 0.\n\n**Bug 2: Double-counting pixel_bytes.** `row_pitch` already equals `width * pixel_bytes`, so the formula should be `row_pitch * height * depth`, not `pixel_bytes * row_pitch * height * depth`.\n\nThis produces a zero-size or incorrectly-sized GPU buffer, causing out-of-bounds writes when texture data is uploaded.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a large texture (e.g., 16384x16384 RGBA8) that requires a shared fallback buffer.\n2. The buffer is allocated with incorrect size, leading to GPU memory corruption.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — arithmetic bug visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}